cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Trackless Links: Safari Extension for Tracking Parameter Removal"
message: "If you use Trackless Links in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Loth
    given-names: Alexander
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-9327-6865"
version: "4.4.1"
date-released: "2026-09-03"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aloth/trackless-links"
url: "https://apps.apple.com/app/id6749830894"
abstract: >
  A Safari extension for iOS, iPadOS and macOS that strips tracking parameters from
  links, blocks cookie banners and warns about low-credibility domains using the CRED-1
  dataset. Link rewriting happens on device; no browsing data leaves it.
keywords:
  - privacy
  - safari extension
  - url tracking
  - cookie banners
  - domain credibility
  - ios
  - macos
